                                          \n                        <\/div>\n                                            <div class=\"content-box bg-color4 rounded-[20px] p-6 relative overflow-hidden transition-all duration-700\">\n                            <div class=\"box-title-wrap transition-all duration-500\">\n                                <span class=\"box-number flex text-[10px] font-bold mb-9 transition-all duration-700 h-[22px] w-[22px] rounded-full bg-color2 justify-center items-center\">\n                                    02                                <\/span>\n    \n                                                                    <h3 class=\"box-title transition-all duration-700 text-2xl\">\n                                        Practical solutions that reduce operational strain                                    <\/h3>\n                                                            <\/div>\n\n                                                            <div class=\"box-content text-sm transition-all duration-700\">\n                                    <p>We build AI models and AI systems that remove manual bottlenecks, improve accuracy, and free your team to focus on higher-value work.<\/p>\n                                <\/div>\n                                                        \n                        <\/div>\n                                            <div class=\"content-box bg-color4 rounded-[20px] p-6 relative overflow-hidden transition-all duration-700\">\n                            <div class=\"box-title-wrap transition-all duration-500\">\n                                <span class=\"box-number flex text-[10px] font-bold mb-9 transition-all duration-700 h-[22px] w-[22px] rounded-full bg-color2 justify-center items-center\">\n                                    03                                <\/span>\n    \n                                                                    <h3 class=\"box-title transition-all duration-700 text-2xl\">\n                                        Built for compliance and organisational trust                                    <\/h3>\n                                                            <\/div>\n\n                                                            <div class=\"box-content text-sm transition-all duration-700\">\n                                    <p>Our responsible AI solutions integrate securely with your existing systems, supporting safer decisions and clearer auditability across the business.<\/p>\n                                <\/div>\n                                                        \n                        <\/div>\n                                            <div class=\"content-box bg-color4 rounded-[20px] p-6 relative overflow-hidden transition-all duration-700\">\n                            <div class=\"box-title-wrap transition-all duration-500\">\n                                <span class=\"box-number flex text-[10px] font-bold mb-9 transition-all duration-700 h-[22px] w-[22px] rounded-full bg-color2 justify-center items-center\">\n                                    04                                <\/span>\n    \n                                                                    <h3 class=\"box-title transition-all duration-700 text-2xl\">\n                                        Clear guidance in a crowded AI market                                    <\/h3>\n                                                            <\/div>\n\n                                                            <div class=\"box-content text-sm transition-all duration-700\">\n                                    <p>We help you cut through the noise, identify where AI will deliver real returns for your business or organisation, and move forward with certainty.<\/p>\n                                <\/div>\n                                                        \n                        <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n                            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n\t\t<style>\n          .content-box:hover .box-number::before {\n            height: 575px;\n            width: 575px;\n          }\n      <\/style>\n  <\/section>\n  <!-- BLOCK CODING STARTS HERE -->\n\t\n  \n\n  <!-- GUTENBERG EDITOR BLOCK PREVIEW - DO NOT REMOVE  -->\r\n    <!-- GUTENBERG EDITOR BLOCK PREVIEW - DO NOT REMOVE  -->\r\n\r\n  <!-- BLOCK CODING STARTS HERE -->\r\n  <section \r\n      id=\"\" \r\n      data-name=\"acf_about-content\"\r\n      data-lazyload=\"1\" \r\n      class=\"relative \" \r\n      style=\"z-index: 0;\">\r\n      <div class=\"about-content-area relative b767:pb-[245px] pb-[200px]\">\r\n        <div class=\"container relative\">\r\n            <div class=\"ab-title-area flex flex-col b1024:flex-row items-start b1024:gap-[140px] gap-6 b1024:mb-20 mb-10 text-center b1024:text-start\">\r\n                <span class=\"block font-semibold text-color1 bg-color4 py-2 px-6 rounded-3xl text-xs mx-auto b1024:mx-0\">About<\/span>\r\n                                    <div class=\"ab-heading w-full b1024:w-auto\">\r\n                                <h2 class=\"h2 animate-watch standard__headline block b1024:max-w-[610px]\">Perth\u2019s AI specialists for <br>teams ready to improve <br>how they work<\/h2>\n                        <\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"ab-logo h-[86px] w-[86px] mx-auto b1024:mx-0 bg-color2 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center\">\r\n                    <svg width=\"51\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 51 22\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M23.7676 0V21.5H20.0898V5.89258C17.5992 14.915 9.53608 21.5391 0 21.5391V17.75C9.48812 17.75 17.209 9.78894 17.209 0H23.7676ZM33.793 0C33.793 9.78679 41.5138 17.75 51.002 17.75V21.5391C41.468 21.5391 33.4028 14.9128 30.9121 5.89258V21.5029H27.2344V0H33.793Z\" fill=\"#131924\"\/><\/svg>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"about-content-wrap flex flex-col-reverse b1024:flex-row\">\r\n                \r\n                                                        <div class=\"b1400:w-[60%] b1200:w-[58%] b1024:w-[50%] mt-20 b1024:mt-0\">\r\n                        <div class=\"hero-video-wrapper relative\" data-video-src=\"https:\/\/player.vimeo.com\/video\/1192463010?autoplay=1&#038;muted=0&#038;background=0&#038;controls=1&#038;title=0&#038;byline=0&#038;portrait=0&#038;dnt=1&#038;sidedock=0\">\r\n\r\n                            <!-- Spacer keeps the wrapper at 16:9 before the iframe loads -->\r\n                            <div class=\"desktop-media w-full\" style=\"aspect-ratio:16\/9;\"><\/div>\r\n\r\n                                                            <div class=\"video-thumbnail absolute inset-0 z-20\">\r\n                                    <picture class=\"w-full h-full\"><source media=\"(min-width: 481px)\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/video-thumbnail.webp\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full\" src=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/video-thumbnail.webp\" alt=\"\" style=\"object-fit:cover;object-position:center;\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"637\" height=\"358\" \/><\/picture>                                <\/div>\r\n                            \r\n                            <button class=\"video-toggle absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center z-30\" aria-label=\"play video toggle button\">\r\n                                <span class=\"play-btn flex items-center justify-center\">\r\n                                    <svg width=\"98\" height=\"98\" viewBox=\"0 0 98 98\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n                                        <circle cx=\"49\" cy=\"49\" r=\"49\" fill=\"#FCFF6A\"\/>\r\n                                        <path d=\"M68 49L39.5 65.4545L39.5 32.5455L68 49Z\" fill=\"#131924\"\/>\r\n                                    <\/svg>\r\n                                <\/span>\r\n                            <\/button>\r\n\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                \r\n                <div class=\"ab-content flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 b1400:w-[40%] b1200:w-[42%] b1024:w-[50%] b1400:pl-[80px] b1024:pl-6\">\r\n                                            <div class=\"hero-summary text-center b1024:text-start\">\r\n                            <p><span class=\"styles-module__ypzdS\">Our team helps organisations take clear, actionable steps with AI, without the noise or confusion. <\/span><\/p>\n<p><span class=\"styles-module__ypzdS\">We focus on the problems that matter most to your business or organisation, delivering practical AI-powered solutions that enhance operational clarity, support your team, and contribute to long-term growth.<\/span><\/p>\n                        <\/div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"button-wrap flex flex-col b767:flex-row items-center justify-center b1024:justify-start gap-3 overflow-hidden\">\r\n                                    <a href=\"#contact-form-popup\" target=\"\" class=\"btn btn-solidcolor1 speak-btn flex items-center gap-3 overflow-hidden\">\n                <span class=\"block circle relative\"><\/span>\n                <span class=\"button-text z-10\">Speak to our team<\/span>\n            <\/a>\n                                                <a href=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/about-us\/\" target=\"\" class=\"btn outline-color1 text-center overflow-hidden relative z-10\">\n                About us            <\/a>\n                                <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n        <script>\r\n            document.querySelectorAll('.hero-video-wrapper').forEach(function(wrapper) {\r\n\r\n                var video     = wrapper.querySelector('.hero-video');\r\n                var button    = wrapper.querySelector('.video-toggle');\r\n                var thumbnail = wrapper.querySelector('.video-thumbnail');\r\n                var media     = wrapper.querySelector('.desktop-media');\r\n                var videoSrc  = wrapper.dataset.videoSrc;\r\n\r\n                if (!button) return;\r\n\r\n                button.addEventListener('click', function() {\r\n\r\n                    if (video) {\r\n                        \/\/ Local video file \u2014 toggle play\/pause\r\n                        if (video.paused) {\r\n                            video.play();\r\n                            video.muted = false;\r\n                            button.style.opacity = '0';\r\n                        } else {\r\n                            video.pause();\r\n                            button.style.opacity = '1';\r\n                        }\r\n                    } else if (videoSrc && media) {\r\n                        \/\/ Vimeo \u2014 create iframe on demand so no assets load until play is clicked\r\n                        var iframe = document.createElement('iframe');\r\n                        iframe.src = videoSrc;\r\n                        iframe.title = 'about content video';\r\n                        iframe.frameBorder = '0';\r\n                        iframe.allow = 'autoplay; fullscreen';\r\n                        iframe.allowFullscreen = true;\r\n                        iframe.style.width = '100%';\r\n                        iframe.style.height = '100%';\r\n                        iframe.style.position = 'absolute';\r\n                        iframe.style.inset = '0';\r\n                        media.appendChild(iframe);\r\n                        if (thumbnail) thumbnail.style.display = 'none';\r\n                        button.style.display = 'none';\r\n                    }\r\n\r\n                });\r\n\r\n            });\r\n        <\/script>\r\n  <\/section>\r\n  <!-- BLOCK CODING STARTS HERE -->\r\n\r\n  \n\n  <!-- GUTENBERG EDITOR BLOCK PREVIEW - DO NOT REMOVE  -->\r\n    <!-- GUTENBERG EDITOR BLOCK PREVIEW - DO NOT REMOVE  -->\r\n\r\n  <!-- BLOCK CODING STARTS HERE -->\r\n  <section \r\n      id=\"services\" \r\n      data-name=\"acf_what-we-do\"\r\n      data-lazyload=\"1\" \r\n      class=\"relative \" \r\n      style=\"z-index: 0;\">\r\n        <div class=\"what-we-do-area b1024:pb-[180px] b767:pb-[140px] pb-100 pt-[125px] bg-color1 text-white relative\">\r\n            <div class=\"we-do-svg absolute b1024:h-[320px] b1024:w-[320px] b767:w-[220px] b767:h-[220px] w-[170px] h-[170px] b1024:-top-[160px] b767:-top-[110px] -top-[85px] b767:right-[100px] right-[24px] bg-color2 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center\">\r\n                <svg width=\"143\" height=\"61\" viewBox=\"0 0 143 61\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M66.2354 0V59.918H55.9873V16.4209C49.0464 41.565 26.5756 60.0254 0 60.0254V49.4668C26.4416 49.4668 47.957 27.28 47.957 0H66.2354ZM94.1729 0C94.1729 27.274 115.688 49.4668 142.13 49.4668V60.0254C115.56 60.0254 93.0835 41.559 86.1426 16.4209V59.9238H75.8945V0H94.1729Z\" fill=\"#131924\"\/><\/svg>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"container\">\r\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col b1024:flex-row\">\r\n                    <div class=\"b1200:w-[30%] b1024:w-[35%] b1024:pt-[115px] b1400:pr-[115px] b1024:pr-8 mb-10 b1024:mb-0\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"subheading-wrap block b1024:hidden\">\r\n                                        <span class=\" animate-watch standard__headline inline-flex font-semibold text-color1 bg-color3 py-2 px-6 rounded-3xl text-xs mx-auto b767:mx-0 b1024:mb-12 mb-8\">What we do<\/span>\n                                <\/div>\r\n                                                                            <div class=\"heading-wrap\">\r\n                                        <h2 class=\"h2 animate-watch standard__headline block b1024:mb-12 mb-8\">Our AI Consulting Services<\/h2>\n                                <\/div>\r\n                                                                            <div class=\"summary-wrap\">\r\n                                <p>We help organisations clarify where AI adds value, design an approach that works with their workflows, and build the custom systems to support it.<\/p>\n<p>Our team also trains your people, ensuring the technology is understood, adopted, and used effectively.<span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\" data-mce-type=\"bookmark\" class=\"mce_SELRES_start\">\ufeff<\/span><\/p>\n                            <\/div>\r\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"b1200:w-[70%] b1024:w-[65%]\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"subheading-wrap mb-8 hidden b1024:block\">\r\n                                        <span class=\" animate-watch standard__headline inline-flex font-semibold text-color1 bg-color3 py-2 px-6 rounded-3xl text-xs mx-auto b767:mx-0 mb-12\">What we do<\/span>\n                                <\/div>\r\n                                                                        <div class=\"\">\r\n                            \r\n                                                            <div class=\"what-we-do-item flex border-b border-color3 pb-[35px] mb-[35px]\">\r\n                                    <span class=\"number-box flex text-[10px] font-bold transition-all duration-700 h-[22px] w-[22px] rounded-full bg-color3 text-color1 justify-center items-center mt-2\">\r\n                                        01                                    <\/span>\r\n                                    <div class=\"flex flex-col b767:flex-row items-end flex-1\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"flex-1 b1400:px-[93px] b767:px-40 px-5\">\r\n                                                                                            <h3 class=\"b1400:text-[68px] b1200:text-[50px] b767:text-[42px] text-[30px] mb-4 leading-[1]\">\r\n                                                    AI Strategy                                                <\/h3>\r\n                                                                                                                                        <div class=\"duration-700 what-we-do-content font-medium\">\r\n                                                    <p>We help you understand where AI makes sense for your business and create a clear, practical roadmap to move forward.<span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\" data-mce-type=\"bookmark\" class=\"mce_SELRES_start\">\ufeff<\/span><\/p>\n                                                <\/div>\r\n                                                                                    <\/div>\r\n                                                                                    <a\r\n                                                aria-label=\"learn more about AI Strategy\" \r\n                                                class=\"btn btn-solidcolor1 min-w-0 flex items-center gap-2 border border-white hover:border-color2 !py-0 min-h-[40px] mt-8 b767:mt-0 overflow-hidden\" \r\n                                                href=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/ai-strategy\/\" \r\n                                                target=\"_self\">\r\n                                                <span class=\"circle relative\"><\/span>\r\n                                                <div class=\"button-text z-10\">Learn more<\/div> \r\n                                                <span class=\"sr-only\"> about AI Strategy<\/span>\r\n                                            <\/a>\r\n                                                                            <\/div>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                                                            <div class=\"what-we-do-item flex border-b border-color3 pb-[35px] mb-[35px]\">\r\n                                    <span class=\"number-box flex text-[10px] font-bold transition-all duration-700 h-[22px] w-[22px] rounded-full bg-color3 text-color1 justify-center items-center mt-2\">\r\n                                        02                                    <\/span>\r\n                                    <div class=\"flex flex-col b767:flex-row items-end flex-1\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"flex-1 b1400:px-[93px] b767:px-40 px-5\">\r\n                                                                                            <h3 class=\"b1400:text-[68px] b1200:text-[50px] b767:text-[42px] text-[30px] mb-4 leading-[1]\">\r\n                                                    Custom AI Development                                                <\/h3>\r\n                                                                                                                                        <div class=\"duration-700 what-we-do-content font-medium\">\r\n                                                    <p><span class=\"styles-module__ypzdS\">We design and build custom AI systems that work inside your current environment, removing bottlenecks and inefficiencies that generic platforms simply can\u2019t address.<\/span><\/p>\n                                                <\/div>\r\n                                                                                    <\/div>\r\n                                                                                    <a\r\n                                                aria-label=\"learn more about Custom AI Development\" \r\n                                                class=\"btn btn-solidcolor1 min-w-0 flex items-center gap-2 border border-white hover:border-color2 !py-0 min-h-[40px] mt-8 b767:mt-0 overflow-hidden\" \r\n                                                href=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/ai-development\/\" \r\n                                                target=\"_self\">\r\n                                                <span class=\"circle relative\"><\/span>\r\n                                                <div class=\"button-text z-10\">Learn more<\/div> \r\n                                                <span class=\"sr-only\"> about Custom AI Development<\/span>\r\n                                            <\/a>\r\n                                                                            <\/div>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                                                            <div class=\"what-we-do-item flex border-b border-color3 pb-[35px] mb-[35px]\">\r\n                                    <span class=\"number-box flex text-[10px] font-bold transition-all duration-700 h-[22px] w-[22px] rounded-full bg-color3 text-color1 justify-center items-center mt-2\">\r\n                                        03                                    <\/span>\r\n                                    <div class=\"flex flex-col b767:flex-row items-end flex-1\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"flex-1 b1400:px-[93px] b767:px-40 px-5\">\r\n                                                                                            <h3 class=\"b1400:text-[68px] b1200:text-[50px] b767:text-[42px] text-[30px] mb-4 leading-[1]\">\r\n                                                    AI Training                                                <\/h3>\r\n                                                                                                                                        <div class=\"duration-700 what-we-do-content font-medium\">\r\n                                                    <p>We run practical AI adoption workshops that give your team the skills, confidence, and understanding they need to use AI effectively in their day-to-day work.<span s